Task 4: Generate a Poem About a Food App
Prompt used: “Write a creative six-line poem about Zomato, highlighting food delivery, delicious meals, convenience, and the happiness of sharing food with friends.”

Output generated by ChatGPT:
A Delicious Ride with Zomato
Hungry hearts and tasty dreams, Zomato brings the perfect themes.

From spicy pizza to sweets so fine, Delicious food arrives right on time.

With friends together, every meal feels great, Zomato makes happiness at the gate.

How GenAI created something new:

ChatGPT used the prompt to generate original lines combining ideas about food, convenience, friendship, and delivery. It learned language patterns during training and used them to construct a new poem rather than simply retrieving a complete existing poem from a database.
Overall Conclusion
Generative AI is transforming everyday applications by helping people create content, communicate more naturally, and complete tasks efficiently. From answering questions and generating images to writing poems and summarizing videos, GenAI offers many practical uses across different industries.